msgstr "在抽屜裡找到的。貨真價實，相信我。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Got it cheap from a guy. Real, I promise."
msgstr "從一個人那兒便宜買的。是真的，我保證。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Grandpa Joe"
msgstr "Grandpa Joe"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Had it appraised for twice that, honest."
msgstr "鑑定價是這個的兩倍，真的。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "How about %d%%? Meet me halfway."
msgstr "%d%%怎麼樣？各讓一步。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "I could stretch to %d%% over. Deal?"
msgstr "我最多能多出%d%%。成交？"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "I pay well for quality, but not that well. %d%% over."
msgstr "我願為品質多付錢，但沒那麼多。溢價%d%%。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Inherited this bar. I'd rather have cash."
msgstr "繼承了這根金條。我更想要現金。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "It's been sitting in my safe deposit box."
msgstr "它一直放在我的保險箱裡。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "June"
msgstr "June"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Kevin"
msgstr "Kevin"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Look, I'd take %d%% of what it's worth. That's fair."
msgstr "聽著，按價值的%d%%我就賣。很公道了。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Marco"
msgstr "Marco"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Melt it down if you don't believe me."
msgstr "你不信就熔了它。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "My cousin says these are worth a fortune."
msgstr "我表哥說這些值一大筆錢。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "My uncle's a jeweller, he says it's the real thing."
msgstr "我叔叔是珠寶商，他說這是真貨。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Need a bit of cash for the car."
msgstr "需要點現金修車。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Need the money for a down payment."
msgstr "需要錢付首付。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "No receipt, but they're solid. Swear."
msgstr "沒有收據，但它們是實心的。我發誓。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "No. I know what this is worth."
msgstr "不行。我知道這東西值多少。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Okay, %d%%, but that's as low as I go."
msgstr "好吧，%d%%，但這是我的底線了。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Old Sal"
msgstr "Old Sal"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Only %d? I'll take what you have."
msgstr "只有%d枚？有多少我要多少。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Price is up, time to cash in."
msgstr "價格漲了，該套現了。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Prices dipped, I'm buying."
msgstr "價格跌了，我來買。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Priya"
msgstr "Priya"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Quick deal? I've got another buyer waiting."
msgstr "快點成交？還有別的買家在等。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Quick sale. No questions, right?"
msgstr "快點賣。不問問題，對吧？"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Selling part of my stack."
msgstr "賣掉一部分囤貨。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Solid gold, real stone. Need cash today."
msgstr "純金，真寶石。今天就要現金。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Spot plus %d%%, final offer."
msgstr "現貨價加%d%%，最後報價。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Spot plus %d%%? I'd pay maybe %d%% over."
msgstr "現貨價加%d%%？我最多出溢價%d%%。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Sterling across the street is cheaper."
msgstr "對街的Sterling更便宜。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Still too low. I know what spot is today."
msgstr "還是太低。我知道今天的現貨價。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Stocks are a casino. I want metal."
msgstr "股市就是賭場。我要金屬。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "That's a lowball for a piece like this. Look again."
msgstr "這種成色出這個價太低了。再看看。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "That's a lowball. I was hoping for closer to %d%%."
msgstr "出價太低了。我希望接近%d%%。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "This was my grandmother's. Never wear it."
msgstr "這是我奶奶的。從來不戴。"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Ugh. Fine. You drive a hard bargain."
msgstr "唉。好吧。你可真會砍價。"

