msgid "Up/Down or W/S set the gas. Bring the furnace into the pour band and hold it there till all of it melts. Drop borax until the scum is gone and the melt shines; too much makes glassy slag that traps metal. Then hold Space to pour: steady, not too fast, and before it cools."
